    dct:description "Faithfully implements the Bi et al. (2015) Eq. (2) dimensionless vertex energy functional (`compute_cell_vertex_energy`, L95-115), regular polygon geometric shape bounds (`regular_polygon_shape_index`, L118-128), zero-temperature T1 energy barrier `Delta e_T1(p_0)` and static shear modulus `G(p_0)` scaling across `p_0^* = 3.813` (`compute_t1_barrier_and_shear_modulus`, L131-183), Atia et al. (2018) `k`-Gamma probability density (`k_gamma_pdf`, L186-194), and 2D periodic vertex-Voronoi relaxation across solid, critical, asthmatic fluid, and `r=0` ablation regimes (`simulate_vertex_unjamming_regime`, L245-380). Backed by 4 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
